@{ViewData["Title"]="Delivery & Returns";}<section class="page-head"><p class="eyebrow">CUSTOMER CARE</p><h1>Delivery & returns</h1><p>Sonada Beds are made to order. Delivery estimates and return eligibility are confirmed with each order based on product and postcode.</p></section><section class="intro"><h2>Made to order</h2><p>Because every bed can be configured, production begins after your order is confirmed. Our customer-care team will keep you updated through the process.</p><h2>Delivery</h2><p>UK delivery is calculated at checkout. Remote and special-access postcodes can carry additional charges.</p><h2>Returns</h2><p>Standard consumer rights apply. Bespoke or personalised items may have different return eligibility; your order confirmation will contain the applicable terms.</p></section>
